                                "sense_id": "5d1ba0c9-16a5-395d-ab4f-27361aab209d",
                                "text": "Somewhat below the middle height, he was lean of body and vulturine of face."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "469585e9-ae48-4383-913b-c7a5e2ea6182",
                                "sense_id": "5d1ba0c9-16a5-395d-ab4f-27361aab209d",
                                "text": "Taking the cooked bird in her gnarled hands she stripped off the flesh with the few teeth she still had left in her head, gnawing on it with a vulturine concentration until it was just grey bones."
                            }
